stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Title
    Title --> Playing : Start (Enter / button)\nspawn burrows + founder, possess, StartCycle
    Playing --> Paused : Esc / P (timeScale = 0)
    Paused --> Playing : Esc / P
    Paused --> Title : Back to title (reload)

    state Playing {
        [*] --> Controlling
        Controlling --> LineageTransfer : possessed rabbit Died
        LineageTransfer --> Controlling : heir found\n(generation + 1)
    }

    Playing --> GameOver : no warren rabbit left
    Playing --> Victory : DayStarted(day > 7)
    GameOver --> Playing : Play again (reload + auto start)
    Victory --> Playing : Play again (reload + auto start)
    GameOver --> Title
    Victory --> Title
